      "excerpt": "Ferretti Scholarship offers one5000award to a minor dependent of active-duty or retired enlisted Air Force, Air Force Reserve, Air National Guard or Space Force personnel. The child record requires a2026high-school graduate entering first year at an accredited university in STEM. Selection considers academic achievement, character and financial need. Required materials include an essay up to600words, signed recommendation, official high-school transcript, acceptance identifying STEM major and first-term tuition/fees. Use the exact provider-linked SmarterSelect program record. NumericGPA, application deadline, current opening and renewal are unverified; military-dependent status alone does not establish all conditions. Recipients must supply aW-9 beforedisbursement;no suchmaterialaccessed.",
