      },
      "excerpt": "Lindsay Memorial Scholarship provides a nonrenewable2500award to a child or legal dependent of an active, veteran, retired, Reserve or National Guard USAF member pursuing an accredited college/university degree. Acceptance is permitted when not yet enrolled. Prior recipients cannot receive another award. Parent AFA membership and STEM major are selection priorities, not mandatory requirements. Submit a statement of purpose, current transcript or acceptance and a recommendation through the exact provider-linked SmarterSelect program. NumericGPA, deadline and current opening were not returned. Recipients must supply aW-9 beforedisbursement;no suchmaterialaccessed.",
