      "excerpt": "Delta Dental Grants provide five2000education awards to an Air/Space Force spouse, dependent or transitioning service member pursuing oral-health or wellness training, certification or a degree. Eligibility may be documented with a transcript, registration or acceptance letter identifying the study area, so acceptance-only entrants are possible. Statement of purpose and recommendation are required. The official parent’s named Learn More and Apply control links the exact SmarterSelect record containing these rules. NumericGPA, application date, current opening and renewal were not returned. This is individual education support, distinct from institutional grants, and the healthcare connection is limited to the provider’s oral-health/wellness field. Recipients must supply aW-9 beforedisbursement;no suchmaterialaccessed.",
